# 13. Conclusion

This project implemented several machine learning algorithms to detect fraudulent insurance claims using historical claim data. Multiple models were trained and evaluated to determine the most effective algorithm.

Among the tested models, **Naïve Bayes and Support Vector Machine achieved the highest accuracy**. The trained model was deployed using a Flask web application to allow users to interact with the system and obtain predictions.

The proposed system can assist insurance companies in identifying suspicious claims and reducing financial losses caused by fraudulent activities.

